  "content": "\n\n<h2>特性</h2>\n<h3>方块/物品</h3>\n<p>以下方块/物品已进行统一，可在相关模组的所有流程与配方中通用。</p>\n<p>模组的优先级由下方的配置部分定义，低优先级模组的物品将在 JEI/REI/EMI 中被隐藏。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>煤焦粉</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersiveengineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>所有 Copycat 方块</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopycats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Copycats+</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Connected</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-dreams-and-desires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CD&D</a></li>\n<li><strong>塑料板</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>六向齿轮箱</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-connected\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Connected</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Utilities</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>流体</h3>\n<p>以下流体已进行统一，可在相关模组的所有流程与配方中通用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原油</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CDG</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-love-war\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">C:L&W</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdestroy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Destroy</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n<li><strong>燃料</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC&A</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-diesel-generators\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CDG</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSnR</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdestroy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Destroy</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-garnished\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Garnished</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a><ul>\n<li>可通过启用模组内置的数据包来禁用其他模组燃料在 Ad Astra 火箭中的兼容性。</li>\n<li>目前仅 TFMG 的燃料能在其发电机中使用，因为 TFMG 不支持自定义燃料类型。（可找到替代方案。）</li></ul></li>\n<li><strong>煤油、熔融/液态塑料、润滑剂/润滑油</strong> - <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpneumaticcraft-repressurized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pneumaticcraft</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-tfmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TFMG</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安装</h2>\n<p>该模组目前仅提供 1.20.1 和 1.21.1 的 (Neo)Forge 版本。Fabric/Quilt 版本即将推出。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falmost-unified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almost Unified</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 为必需安装的依赖项。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d757\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ddEBPlA.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting（官方合作伙伴）- 使用代码 AMRONOS\">\n</a></p>\n<p>Modrinth 链接：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddoncompatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/createaddoncompatibility</a></p>\n<h2>兼容性配置</h2>\n<p>若要更改兼容性的模组优先级，请修改 <code>config/almostunified/unify.json</code> 中的 <code>modPriorities</code> 字段。更多信息请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/almostunified/wiki/Unification-Config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<p>默认优先级顺序（从高到低）如下：</p>\n<pre><code>pneumaticcraft\ncopycats\ncreate_connected\ncreate_dd\ntfmg</code></pre>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>模组内含若干数据包，允许你更改不同模组间兼容性的某些设置。</p>\n<p>你可以在创建世界时启用它们，或使用 <code>/datapack enable</code> 命令进行启用。</p>\n<h2>建议 / 更多兼容性功能</h2>\n<p>我计划添加更多兼容性功能。如果你有任何想法，欢迎在 GitHub 上提交 Issue，或在 Discord 服务器中告知我。</p>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<p>感谢：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>为本模组添加兼容性的各个模组的创作者们。</li>\n<li>AlmostReliable 团队开发的 Almost Unified 模组，没有它本模组将极难制作。</li>\n</ol>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
